OL,3,GNEWSAThousands gather to celebrate
OL,4,ADiwali in Leicester
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester's Diwali celebrations
OL,7,Fattracted about 30,000 people to the
OL,8,Fcity on Sunday.
OL,10,FThe annual Diwali festivities - among
OL,11,Fthe largest outside India - saw the
OL,12,FGolden Mile along Belgrave Road
OL,13,Filluminated, the return of the Wheel of
OL,14,FLight and venues hosting exhibitions,
OL,15,Fworkshops and family activities.
OL,17,FDiwali, the festival of light, is
OL,18,Fcelebrated by Hindu, Sikh and Jain
OL,19,Fcommunities and is associated with the
OL,20,Ftriumph of light over darkness, good
OL,21,Fover evil and hope over despair.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
