OL,3,GNEWSAThousands gather to celebrate
OL,4,ADiwali in Leicester
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople gathered in the city on the
OL,7,Fweekend, with the main focus of
OL,8,Fcelebrations at Cossington Recreation
OL,9,FGround, where a full philharmonic
OL,10,Forchestra was one of a number of
OL,11,Fperformers.
